### Slot Detection

Slots are identified at runtime via a static `__SLOT_TYPE` property on each subcomponent (not `displayName`). Static properties survive minification, unlike `displayName` which is a debugging aid only.

```tsx
AssetItemLogo.__SLOT_TYPE = 'logo';
AssetItemContent.__SLOT_TYPE = 'content';
AssetItemSymbol.__SLOT_TYPE = 'symbol';
AssetItemName.__SLOT_TYPE = 'name';
AssetItemLabel.__SLOT_TYPE = 'label';
AssetItemPrice.__SLOT_TYPE = 'price';
AssetItemChange.__SLOT_TYPE = 'change';
AssetItemTrailing.__SLOT_TYPE = 'trailing';
AssetItemRateChip.__SLOT_TYPE = 'rate-chip';
AssetItemDivider.__SLOT_TYPE = 'divider';
AssetItemSkeleton.__SLOT_TYPE = 'skeleton';

// useAssetItemChildren reads __SLOT_TYPE to classify children
const getSlotType = (child: ReactNode): SlotType | undefined =>
  isValidElement(child) ? (child.type as { __SLOT_TYPE?: SlotType }).__SLOT_TYPE : undefined;
```

The hook returns the first match for each slot, except `RateChip` — multiple chips are collected and rendered together. JSX order does not matter — render order depends on the active `layout` (see "Layout Rules" below).

### Two Render Paths

The root has exactly two render paths based on children:

1. **Skeleton mode** — when `EtAssetItem.Skeleton` is a child, only the skeleton is rendered. Size, style, and testID are inherited from the parent unless explicitly set on the skeleton. If `EtAssetItem.Divider` is also present, it is rendered below the skeleton.
2. **Standard mode** — a column `View` containing a row of slots, plus an optional divider below. When `EtAssetItem.Divider` is present, the wrapper uses `paddingTop` only so the divider sits at the bottom edge; otherwise `paddingVertical` applies normally.

When `onPress` is provided and `disabled` is `false`, the wrapper is rendered as `Pressable` with `accessibilityRole="button"`. Otherwise it's a plain `View`.

## API

### Props (root)

| Prop                 | Type                              | Default     | Description                                                                                                                                |
| -------------------- | --------------------------------- | ----------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |
| `children`           | `EtAssetItemChildren`             | -           | Compound subcomponents (Logo, Content, Symbol, Name, Label, Price, Change, Trailing, RateChip, Divider, Skeleton)                          |
| `size`               | `'large' \| 'small'`              | `'large'`   | Vertical padding + logo size (`large` → 36px logo, X4 padding; `small` → 24px logo, X3 padding)                                            |
| `layout`             | `'default' \| 'trading-view'`     | `'default'` | Row layout. `trading-view` moves Change under Symbol and renders RateChip siblings on the right; ignores Price and Trailing                |
| `disabled`           | `boolean`                         | `false`     | Lowers opacity to 0.5 and disables press handling                                                                                          |
| `onPress`            | `() => void`                      | -           | Press handler. When set (and not disabled), the row becomes a `Pressable` with `accessibilityRole="button"`                                |
| `style`              | `StyleProp<ViewStyle>`            | -           | Container style override                                                                                                                   |
| `testID`             | `string`                          | -           | Test ID for testing                                                                                                                        |
| `accessibilityLabel` | `string`                          | -           | Accessibility label for the row                                                                                                            |
| `accessibilityHint`  | `string`                          | -           | Accessibility hint for the row                                                                                                             |

### Subcomponents

| Subcomponent           | Purpose                                                                                                              | Required props |
| ---------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | -------------- |
| `EtAssetItem.Logo`     | Square instrument avatar (wraps `EtAvatar` with `variant="instrument"`, `shape="square"`); accepts optional `fallback`, `imageBackgroundColor`, and `marketStatus` | none           |
| `EtAssetItem.Content`  | Vertical container for `Symbol`/`Name` (`flex: 1`)                                                                   | `children`     |
| `EtAssetItem.Symbol`   | Primary line, single-line ellipsized, `label-primary-semibold`                                                       | `children`     |
| `EtAssetItem.Name`     | Secondary line, single-line ellipsized, `label-tertiary-regular`                                                     | `children`     |
| `EtAssetItem.Label`    | Opinionated middle-slot pill (wraps `EtBadge size="small"`)                                                          | `children`     |
| `EtAssetItem.Price`    | Right-aligned pre-formatted price string (`default` layout only — ignored in `trading-view`)                         | `value`        |
| `EtAssetItem.Change`   | Pre-formatted change string with sentiment-driven color. Layout-aware: right-aligned in `default`, left-aligned + `num-xs` under Symbol in `trading-view` | `value`        |
| `EtAssetItem.Trailing` | Arbitrary right-side slot (replaces the legacy `rightElement` prop, `default` layout only — ignored in `trading-view`) | `children`     |
| `EtAssetItem.RateChip` | Display-only sentiment-colored pill rendered in the right-hand slot of `trading-view`. Compose multiple chips for Buy/Sell quotes | `value`        |
| `EtAssetItem.Divider`  | Hairline separator below the row                                                                                     | none           |
| `EtAssetItem.Skeleton` | Loading placeholder shaped like a real asset row; inherits parent size                                               | none           |

All subcomponents accept `style` and `testID`. `Logo` additionally accepts `source`, `fallback`, `imageBackgroundColor`, `marketStatus`, `marketStatusTestID`, `onError`, and `accessibilityLabel`. `Label` accepts a `color: BadgeColor` (default `'neutral'`). `Change` accepts `sentiment: 'positive' | 'negative' | 'neutral'` (default `'neutral'`). `RateChip` accepts `sentiment: 'positive' | 'negative' | 'neutral'` (default `'neutral'`) and an optional `label` (e.g. `"Buy"`, `"Sell"`). `Skeleton` accepts `variant: 'symbol-only' | '2-lines' | 'rate-chips'` (default `'2-lines'`) and an optional `size` override.

## Swipe-to-Reveal Actions

`EtAssetItem` intentionally has **no** swipe API. Wrap with `EtSwipeableRow` from `etoro-ui` to add swipe actions. Place the asset row first, then compose `EtSwipeableRow.Action` subcomponents as direct children after it.

```tsx
import { EtAssetItem, EtSwipeableRow } from 'etoro-ui';

<EtSwipeableRow
  isDragging={isAnyItemDragging}
  onSwipeStart={(close) => {
    if (activeCloseRef.current && activeCloseRef.current !== close) {
      activeCloseRef.current();
    }
    activeCloseRef.current = close;
  }}
>
  <EtAssetItem onPress={openAsset} accessibilityLabel="AAPL">
    <EtAssetItem.Logo source={asset.logoUri} />
    <EtAssetItem.Content>
      <EtAssetItem.Symbol>AAPL</EtAssetItem.Symbol>
      <EtAssetItem.Name>Apple Inc</EtAssetItem.Name>
    </EtAssetItem.Content>
    <EtAssetItem.Price value="$186.79" />
    <EtAssetItem.Change value="1.95 (-1.03%)" sentiment="negative" />
    <EtAssetItem.Divider />
  </EtAssetItem>

  <EtSwipeableRow.Action onPress={handleTrade} style={{ backgroundColor: '#4ECDC4' }} accessibilityLabel="Trade">
    <TradeIcon />
  </EtSwipeableRow.Action>
  <EtSwipeableRow.Action onPress={handleRemove} style={{ backgroundColor: '#FF6B6B' }} width={80} accessibilityLabel="Delete">
    <TrashIcon />
  </EtSwipeableRow.Action>
</EtSwipeableRow>;
```

See `libs/etoro-ui/src/components/list/swipeable-row/AGENTS.mdc` for the full `EtSwipeableRow` API.

